From 9acb47809cecec8425e59015f63d00ac52b9d324 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:46:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/57] Later moves, batch 1: 74 moves and the modern tutor

74 Gen 4+ moves that reuse Gen 3 battle effects, with modern data from
Showdown, tinted copies of existing animations, level-up and egg
learnsets. A new tutor in the Viridian City Pokemon Center teaches each
Pokemon its modern TM/tutor moves (badge-gated by power); the post-game
Move Maniac offers them too. Generated by tools/hack/moves.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
